      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "Classify customer feedback into: Bug, Feature Request, or Praise.\n\nExamples:\n\"The app crashes when I rotate my phone\" -> Bug\n\"Would love dark mode support\" -> Feature Request\n\"Best app I've used in years!\" -> Praise\n\"Login fails with my Google account\" -> Bug\n\"Can you add export to PDF?\" -> Feature Request\n\nNow classify: \"The search is so fast, I'm impressed\"\n-> Praise"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "prompt = '''Extract structured data from product reviews.\n\nExample 1:\nReview: \"Great headphones but battery only lasts 3 hours\"\nOutput: {\"product\": \"headphones\", \"sentiment\": \"mixed\", \"issue\": \"battery life\", \"metric\": \"3 hours\"}\n\nExample 2:\nReview: \"Worst keyboard ever. Keys started sticking after 2 weeks\"\nOutput: {\"product\": \"keyboard\", \"sentiment\": \"negative\", \"issue\": \"key sticking\", \"metric\": \"2 weeks\"}\n\nNow extract:\nReview: \"Love the camera quality on this phone, 48MP is stunning\"\nOutput:'''\n# Model outputs: {\"product\": \"phone\", \"sentiment\": \"positive\", \"issue\": null, \"metric\": \"48MP\"}"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "Convert natural language to SQL.\n\nExamples:\n\"How many users signed up last month?\"\n-> SELECT COUNT(*) FROM users WHERE created_at >= DATE_TRUNC('month', CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL '1 month') AND created_at < DATE_TRUNC('month', CURRENT_DATE);\n\n\"Top 5 products by revenue\"\n-> SELECT product_name, SUM(amount) as revenue FROM orders GROUP BY product_name ORDER BY revenue DESC LIMIT 5;\n\nNow convert: \"Users who have not logged in for 30 days\"\n->"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ],
